- `test_R1_S1_default_greeting` fails because alpha has no greeting.
- `test_R1_S2_name_too_long` fails because alpha has no greeting.
- `test_R2_S1_startup_line` fails because the first line is the banner.

I added those lines to `changes/add-greeting/ledger.md`, and the ledger passed the checks too.

**Two things for you:**
